{"files":[{"hunks":[{"lines":["+import gzip, json, os, collections, re","+base=\"/app/agent_rl/data/runs\"","+for run in sorted(os.listdir(base)):","+    eps=[json.loads(l) for l in gzip.open(os.path.join(base,run,\"episodes.jsonl.gz\"),\"rt\")]","+    meta=json.load(open(os.path.join(base,run,\"run.json\")))","+    turns=sum(len(e[\"turns\"]) for e in eps)","+    print(f\"\\n=== {run} {meta} eps={len(eps)} turns={turns}\")","+    print(\" ep keys\", eps[0].keys())","+    print(\" turn keys\", eps[0][\"turns\"][0].keys())","+    fr=collections.Counter()","+    for e in eps:","+        for t in e[\"turns\"]:","+            fr[json.dumps(t.get(\"finish_reason\"))]+=1","+    print(\" finish\", fr.most_common(10))","+    print(\" recorded calls per turn dist\", collections.Counter(len(t.get(\"calls\") or []) for e in eps for t in e[\"turns\"]))","+    # first turn text preview","+    t=eps[0][\"turns\"][0]","+    print(\" prompt type\", type(eps[0][\"prompt\"]), str(eps[0][\"prompt\"])[:600].replace(chr(10),\"\\\\n\"))","+    print(\" text0\", t[\"text\"][:1200].replace(chr(10),\"\\\\n\"))","+    print(\" calls0\", t.get(\"calls\"))"],"newLines":20,"newStart":1,"oldLines":0,"oldStart":1}],"path":"/tmp/inspect_runs.py"}]}